===Etymology===
From {{der|en|NL.|neuralgia}}, from {{der|en|grc|νεῦρον||nerve}} + {{m|grc|ἄλγος||pain}}; synchronically, {{affix|en|neur-|-algia}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology|neurology}} An acute, severe, intermittent [[pain]] that radiates along a [[nerve]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|neuralgy}}
* {{l|en|neurodynia}}

====Hyponyms====
